# Bill Splitter
// Who owes what after a meal:  each person pays for what they ordered, and their share of the tip.
// Change a name, an amount or the tip, and every sum follows.
// A diner is this project's own, in `Diner.spell`, and how money is written is in `Money.spell`:
// this file holds the bill.

## The bill

bill splitter is an app:
	- its "diners" is a new table
	// The tip, as a part of what was ordered:  kept as its fraction, so 18% is 0.18
	- its "percent" is a percent starting at 18%
	// What everyone ordered, added up
	- its "subtotal" is:
		set added up to 0
		for diner in the diners
			set added up to added up + the diner's amount
		return added up
	- its "tip" is the subtotal * the percent
	- its "total" is the subtotal + the tip

	// Three diners to start with
	- to create it:
		add (a new diner with name = "Ana", amount = 24) to the diners
		add (a new diner with name = "Ben", amount = 18.5) to the diners
		add (a new diner with name = "Cleo", amount = 31.25) to the diners
	// An empty row, for the next person
	- to add someone:
		- icon "plus"
		add (a new diner with name = "", amount = 0) to the diners

	// The tip, the diners, then the sums
	- to draw it:
		<ui-container text>
			<ui-stack>
				<ui-header level="2">Bill Splitter</ui-header>
				<ui-form value={it}>
					<ui-stack direction="horizontal" spacing="sm">
						<ui-text bold>Tip</ui-text>
						<ui-input name="percent" type="percent" min="0" step="1" aria-label="Tip percent"/>
						<ui-buttons size="small" appearance="basic">
							<ui-button onClick={set the percent to 15%}>15%</ui-button>
							<ui-button onClick={set the percent to 18%}>18%</ui-button>
							<ui-button onClick={set the percent to 20%}>20%</ui-button>
						</ui-buttons>
					</ui-stack>
				</ui-form>
				{draw the diners}
				<ui-stack direction="horizontal">
					<ui-button appearance="basic" icon="plus" onClick={add someone}>Add someone</ui-button>
				</ui-stack>
				<ui-segment>
					<ui-statistics widths="3" size="small">
						<ui-statistic value={write the subtotal as money} label="Ordered"/>
						<ui-statistic value={write the tip as money} label="Tip"/>
						<ui-statistic value={write the total as money} label="Total" color="green"/>
					</ui-statistics>
				</ui-segment>
			</ui-stack>
		</ui-container>
